{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8000_place", "source_sha256": "d06f29f4ba7ec3bd67ac0359e94c2a131813275b930237b20eaceec7e0410703", "ja": "闇の大病院", "zh": "暗黑大医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8001_p", "source_sha256": "a22b6223fc076ec55482361e81dc8238eaed8f73b368cfff987ba89bf122c5f7", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画\nの撮影日。真のテーマは『闇の病院で働くナース』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划拍摄日。真这次的主题是“在黑暗医院工作的护士”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8002_006mak", "source_sha256": "ec2e7c372feb384e0ef4fa14dee856bc3a6210786b67d557b928c9f09753c177", "ja": "衣装もカワイイし、セットも本格的で……\nくーっ、楽しみだなぁ♪", "zh": "服装好可爱，布景也很专业……哎呀，真让人期待啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8003_p", "source_sha256": "3ee23d247ae79e40bf764c38e47645358a614bb061bb5a522752360a4890ecc1", "ja": "気合い十分みたいだな。……『闇のナース』って\nいう少し特殊なテーマだけど、問題なさそうか？", "zh": "看起来干劲十足啊。……虽然主题是“黑暗护士”这种有点特别的风格，你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8004_006mak", "source_sha256": "0d7ba9777b569fcb7443c136f66fab04f940e9dd393acdbb1528ffd2fb0e4f6b", "ja": "そうですね。一応、ボクなりに色々考えて、\nイメージトレーニングはしてきたんです！", "zh": "是啊。我也认真思考了一番，按自己的方式做了各种形象训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8005_006mak", "source_sha256": "388397640b2b59631e51a5ef7ae45bcbc4f757006f5b36155bd30be6708c67d9", "ja": "{$P$}。\n本番まで、練習に付き合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n在正式演出前，能陪我练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8006_p", "source_sha256": "ff54c1d80fbe2d187b14d6cfa6c19b9611a7eccafeb534d92439a1de19985383", "ja": "もちろん！　……と言いたかったんだが、すまない。\n仕事の電話をしなきゃいけなくて……。", "zh": "当然可以！……我本来是想这么说的，抱歉。\n我还得打个工作电话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8007_006mak", "source_sha256": "daf1e45b24bcffa2c036f45877f062e3033bba223c88571ca76c32dd8a49366e", "ja": "あ、そうなんですね。\n……。そう、ですか……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样啊。\n……这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8008_006mak", "source_sha256": "c4bdeacd21422f639b7ee0caf8af0f4a3a3b67eb4870b739756de098515822d3", "ja": "「……それって、他の人を優先するってことですか？\nボクよりも大事……？　ねえ……答えてください！」", "zh": "“……这意思是说，你要优先考虑其他人吗？\n觉得比我还重要吗……？喂……请回答我！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8009", "source_sha256": "48effaf7f9c534e7db2a7f13d0cc7140e350614a5a10b6eff471496ea4d62762", "ja": "違いますっ！", "zh": "不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8010", "source_sha256": "e266451a53aec0a7fa814efad2def9462d983be157b239551e1cc89fa86c679a", "ja": "ゾクッ……！", "zh": "一阵寒意……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8011", "source_sha256": "a9e220a7bcd05250863e20893a0bb1a15b470ad5d5c855bfbcc1dc57fa40534a", "ja": "ごめん！", "zh": "抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8100_p", "source_sha256": "c4329630d70549debd312c3d32d49fc2888454f2c339707895923604e66095c9", "ja": "ち、違いますっ！　わかりました！\n電話は後にして、今は真を優先します、から……！", "zh": "不、不是！我明白了！\n先把电话放一边，现在优先处理真……才不是，我是说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8101_006mak", "source_sha256": "14cdd8cfe6fea03c528763e7e96100243ce7b10b949c11f4adbfacb51e9c2e93", "ja": "えっ？　……あっ。い、今のは冗談ですよ、冗談！\nボクは大丈夫ですから、仕事を優先してください。", "zh": "诶？……啊。刚、刚才那是在开玩笑啦，开玩笑！\n我没事的，请优先处理工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8102_p", "source_sha256": "43cfafabaf7b385026436863b74a921eaf95e67dfa37c5164065a7459c729046", "ja": "……ハッ！　迫真の演技だったから、思わず。\nうん、イメトレの成果はバッチリだな！", "zh": "……哈！演得太逼真了，我不自觉就……\n嗯，意象训练的效果非常完美呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8103_006mak", "source_sha256": "328484aff1cd06ed8d6bd6389a9d8f1f7653f8df3165c84cfeb7a8c11177f04a", "ja": "そんなに、よかったですか？　へへっ、やーりぃ！\nこれなら本番も、大丈夫そうです♪", "zh": "真的有那么好吗？嘿嘿，太棒啦！\n这样一来，正式演出应该也没问题了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8200_p", "source_sha256": "75149ef897b463028ff3f1442a1b22d08b1c4feab8d8a476af6e71ca2e4f0a1e", "ja": "お、おお……ビックリしたぁ。\nいい演技じゃないか、真！　……真？", "zh": "啊、啊啊……吓我一跳。\n演得不错嘛，真！……真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8201_006mak", "source_sha256": "5e33cd4abe248a6a9d298eb04156875ea8908f805576baa571f55ca6aad52cb8", "ja": "「……答えになってないですよ？　ねえ、どうして\nボクが一番じゃないの？　相手は……誰、なの……？」", "zh": "「……这根本算不上回答吧？呐，为什么\n我不是你的第一顺位呢？对方……到底是谁……？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8202_006mak", "source_sha256": "09adf2c0b50fb55763950798d41ffc862228e541d2160801ff17eafe09adda0b", "ja": "……なーんて！　ボクは大丈夫なので、電話……あれ？\n青い顔して、どうしました、{$P$}？", "zh": "……开玩笑啦！我没事的，电话……咦？\n您脸色这么难看，怎么了吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8300_p", "source_sha256": "4a1863b69fd9a69f28daf95a2e75594175ea68d345de881696cd22415a5189f4", "ja": "ごめんな、真。急ぎの連絡なんだ。それが終わったら\n練習に付き合うから……本当にゴメン！", "zh": "对不起，真。是很急的联络。等处理完之后，我会陪你练习……真的很抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8301_006mak", "source_sha256": "ae61fe98d5231c45555dc649610bfc9d7f0b5ed1fb1a960f0e867f4bc13098eb", "ja": "え？　そんなに謝らないでください！\nえっと、今の演技のつもりだったんですけど……。", "zh": "诶？不用那么道歉啦！\n那个，我刚才只是打算演戏来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_8302_006mak", "source_sha256": "8540899294b2864a074c8219da0d9b0c75823220c39b55d1bc56adbd4a25fe1e", "ja": "う～ん、ボクの演技もまだまだかな。\n本番までに考え直さないとダメかも……。", "zh": "嗯～，看来我的演技还差得远呢。\n可能得在正式演出前重新考虑一下了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
